          "updatedAt": 1778705220000,
          "parts": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这条同时测试 Markdown LaTeX 和 HTML 数学排版。行内公式：$a^2+b^2=c^2$。\n\n<div class='math-block' style='background:#fff7ed;color:#1f2937;border:1px solid #fed7aa;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;font-family:Georgia,serif;'>\n  <style>\n    .formula-box{background:white;border:1px solid #fdba74;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;margin:10px 0;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(251,146,60,.18);}\n    .math-pill{display:inline-block;background:#ffedd5;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 8px;margin:2px;color:#9a3412;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;}\n  </style>\n  <h3 style='margin-top:0;'>热力学小结</h3>\n  <p>水的化学式是 H<sub>2</sub>O，二氧化碳是 CO<sub>2</sub>，能量关系可写作 E = mc<sup>2</sup>。</p>\n  <div class='formula-box'>dU = T dS - P dV + μ dN</div>\n  <div class='formula-box'>ΔG = ΔH - TΔS</div>\n  <p><span class='math-pill'>T</span><span class='math-pill'>P</span><span class='math-pill'>V</span><span class='math-pill'>S</span></p>\n  <table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;'>\n    <thead><tr><th style='border-bottom:2px solid #fdba74;text-align:left;padding:6px;'>符号</th><th style='border-bottom:2px solid #fdba74;text-align:left;padding:6px;'>含义</th><th style='border-bottom:2px solid #fdba74;text-align:left;padding:6px;'>单位</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px;'>T</td><td style='padding:6px;'>Temperature</td><td style='padding:6px;'>K</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px;'>P</td><td style='padding:6px;'>Pressure</td><td style='padding:6px;'>Pa</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px;'>ΔG</td><td style='padding:6px;'>Gibbs free energy</td><td style='padding:6px;'>J</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n块级公式仍然需要独立渲染：\n\n$$\n\\Delta G = \\Delta H - T\\Delta S\n$$"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
